    "title": "<p>Differential diagnosis for Waldenstr&ouml;m macroglobulinaemia&ndash;type lymphoplasmacytic lymphoma (LPL-WM), IgM monoclonal gammopathy of undetermined significance (IgM&nbsp;MGUS), and IgM-related disorders</p>",
    "legend": "",
    "source": "Santiago Montes-Moreno",
    "copyright": "",
    "tablehtml": "<table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse; mso-table-layout-alt: fixed; mso-yfti-tbllook: 1184; mso-padding-alt: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 0; mso-yfti-firstrow: yes; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 175.5pt; border: none; border-top: solid black 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid black .5pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"234\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Entity</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 133.3pt; border: none; border-top: solid black 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid black .5pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"178\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">IgM monoclonal protein</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 133.3pt; border: none; border-top: solid black 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid black .5pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"178\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Bone marrow infiltration</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 133.3pt; border: none; border-top: solid black 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid black .5pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"178\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">IgM-related symptoms</span></strong></p>\r\n</td